# The build context holds what docker/api/Dockerfile needs and nothing else:
# everything is ignored, then the API's sources are let back in. A file that is
# not listed, .env first of all, cannot end up in an image.
*

!.editorconfig
!Directory.Build.props
!Directory.Build.targets
!src/api
!src/graph-engine
!tools/analyzers

**/bin
**/obj
**/*.user
